   DAASI-3640 | 27: the view, rehearsed before it deploys and checked after
   Read-only. Nothing is created. Run as DAAS_TEAM in one worksheet.

   The view is one SELECT, so it can be tried out before anyone deploys
   it. Queries 1 to 3 run the new text from 08 as a plain query beside
   the view that is live today. They need the fact column
   COMMENTS_EXTENDED, so they run in UAT now, and in PROD once the table
   file is deployed there (change the USE line: queries 1 to 3 name no
   database).

     1  every other column, every row: unchanged
     2  the comment column: untouched without remarks, right with them
     3  a few comps to look at
     4  PROD: who reads the comment column today
     5  after the view deploys: owner, columns, tags, grants

   Query 3 returns comp numbers and note text with employee names in
   it. Its result stays off the ticket.
   ===================================================================== */

USE DATABASE DAAS_UAT;


